{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium interactive section that showcases the benefits of infrared saunas. The design should feel luxurious, modern and minimalist with generous spacing, clean typography and a high-end wellness aesthetic.
    
    At the top of the section, include a small uppercase subtitle above the main heading.
    
    Subtitle: Supported by Modern Research
    
    Heading: Sauna Benefits
    
    Tab Navigation
    
    Below the heading, create a compact, centred tab switcher with three tabs:
    
    Performance
    Health
    Longevity
    
    The tab switcher should have:
    
    Square or very slightly rounded corners (maximum 4px border radius)
    Equal-width tabs
    A thin border around the entire tab switcher
    A solid background for the active tab with white text
    Transparent background for inactive tabs with dark text
    Subtle hover effects
    Premium typography
    
    Do not use pill-shaped or fully rounded tabs.
    
    Tab Animation
    
    When switching between tabs:
    
    Use a smooth sliding animation rather than an instant change.
    The active tab indicator should glide smoothly from one tab to another.
    The content below should fade and slide in simultaneously.
    The transition should feel fluid and premium, similar to Apple's product pages.
    Avoid any flickering or page jumping.
    Preload all images so the transitions happen instantly without loading delays.
    Main Content
    
    Below the tabs, display one large image with rounded corners.
    
    Each tab should have its own editable image that can be uploaded separately through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    Below the image, display a responsive grid containing six benefit cards.
    
    Each card should include:
    
    Bold benefit title
    Short description
    No icons
    Left-aligned text
    Dynamic Content
    
    When switching between Performance, Health and Longevity, all of the following should change instantly:
    
    Large image
    Six benefit titles
    Six benefit descriptions
    
    No page reloads.
    
    Shopify Theme Editor Settings
    General
    Subtitle
    Heading
    Background colour
    Text colour
    Active tab colour
    Inactive tab colour
    Tab border colour
    Section width
    Maximum content width
    Top and bottom padding
    Image border radius
    Animation on/off
    Performance Tab
    Upload image
    Six editable benefit titles
    Six editable benefit descriptions
    Health Tab
    Upload image
    Six editable benefit titles
    Six editable benefit descriptions
    Longevity Tab
    Upload image
    Six editable benefit titles
    Six editable benefit descriptions
    Desktop Layout
    Centred heading
    Compact centred tab switcher
    Large image below tabs
    Six benefit cards displayed in three columns
    Consistent spacing throughout
    Mobile Layout
    
    Optimise the section specifically for mobile devices.
    
    The tab switcher should become more compact.
    Ensure the complete tab switcher fits within the screen width without overflowing.
    Do not allow the tabs to wrap onto multiple lines.
    Keep all three tabs visible at the same time.
    Reduce horizontal padding and font size where necessary while maintaining readability.
    The tab switcher should remain centred.
    The image should appear below the tabs.
    Benefit cards should stack into a single column with generous spacing.
    Maintain large touch targets for easy interaction.
    Styling
    Premium luxury wellness aesthetic
    Soft neutral colours
    Clean minimalist design
    Large amounts of white space
    Smooth hover effects
    Elegant typography
    Fast loading
    Fully responsive
    Optimised for performance
    
    Build this section using Shopify Liquid, HTML, CSS and vanilla JavaScript only. Do not use any external libraries or apps. The section should be modular, easy to customise from the Shopify Theme Editor and designed to match the look and feel of a premium high-ticket wellness brand., Give me option to change active tab text ciolour, hav performance tab preloaded and have all the images pre loaded for all the tabs for speed.
    
    Give me option for alignment for text but keep center aligned as default
    
    , Give me ability to change the font family every where.
    
    Give me ability to change the colour of the text everywhere.
    
    Give me accessto control the height and width of tab navigation separately in mobile and computer mode, For tab navigation, can you give me different styles that I can choose out of, for pill sand bordered in tab navigation, can you give me access to control the radius, the tab height and width should also apply to pills and other structured formats so that one button can control the height regardsless of the style, ensure mobile tab and height work on pills or bordered , allow me to add separate images for mobile and computer mode, Give me access to control the height and width of tab selector in pill mode
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-sauna-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_content_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    width: {{ block.settings.section_width }}%;
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.subtitle_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.subtitle_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subtitle_font.weight }};
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    opacity: 0.7;
    color: {{ block.settings.subtitle_color }};
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: 48px;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-tabs-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    position: relative;
    background-color: transparent;
  }

  {% if block.settings.tab_style == 'bordered' %}
    .ai-sauna-benefits-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.tab_border_color }};
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.tab_border_radius }}px;
    }
  {% elsif block.settings.tab_style == 'underline' %}
    .ai-sauna-benefits-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.tab_border_color }};
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }
  {% elsif block.settings.tab_style == 'pills' %}
    .ai-sauna-benefits-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 12px;
    }
  {% elsif block.settings.tab_style == 'minimal' %}
    .ai-sauna-benefits-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 24px;
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.tab_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.tab_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.tab_font.weight }};
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    color: {{ block.settings.inactive_tab_color }};
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding: {{ block.settings.tab_height_desktop }}px {{ block.settings.tab_width_desktop }}px;
  }

  {% if block.settings.tab_style == 'underline' %}
    .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-bottom: 16px;
    }
  {% elsif block.settings.tab_style == 'pills' %}
    .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.tab_pill_radius }}px;
      border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.tab_border_color }};
      padding: {{ block.settings.pill_height_desktop }}px {{ block.settings.pill_width_desktop }}px;
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    color: {{ block.settings.active_tab_text_color }};
  }

  {% if block.settings.tab_style == 'pills' %}
    .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
      background-color: {{ block.settings.active_tab_color }};
      border-color: {{ block.settings.active_tab_color }};
    }
  {% elsif block.settings.tab_style == 'minimal' %}
    .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
      font-weight: 600;
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-indicator-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.active_tab_color }};
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), width 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  {% if block.settings.tab_style == 'bordered' %}
    .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-indicator-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.tab_border_radius | minus: 1 }}px;
    }
  {% elsif block.settings.tab_style == 'underline' %}
    .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-indicator-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      height: 2px;
    }
  {% elsif block.settings.tab_style == 'pills' %}
    .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-indicator-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }
  {% elsif block.settings.tab_style == 'minimal' %}
    .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-indicator-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      height: 1px;
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-sauna-benefits-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 400px;
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease;
    transform: translateY(20px);
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
    position: relative;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    max-height: 400px;
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 30px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 12px 24px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.card_title_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.card_title_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.card_title_font.weight }};
    font-size: 20px;
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_color }};
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.card_description_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.card_description_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.card_description_font.weight }};
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.8;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_description_color }};
  }

  .ai-sauna-benefits-preload-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-sauna-benefits-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 36px;
    }

    .ai-sauna-benefits-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 30px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-sauna-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top | times: 0.7 }}px 16px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-sauna-benefits-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .ai-sauna-benefits-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .ai-sauna-benefits-tabs-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      padding: 0 10px;
    }

    {% if block.settings.tab_style == 'bordered' or block.settings.tab_style == 'underline' %}
      .ai-sauna-benefits-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 100%;
      }
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.tab_style == 'pills' or block.settings.tab_style == 'minimal' %}
      .ai-sauna-benefits-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        gap: 8px;
      }
    {% endif %}

    .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 13px;
      min-width: 0;
      padding: {{ block.settings.tab_height_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.tab_width_mobile }}px;
    }

    {% if block.settings.tab_style == 'bordered' or block.settings.tab_style == 'underline' %}
      .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        flex: 1;
      }
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.tab_style == 'underline' %}
      .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        padding-bottom: 12px;
      }
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.tab_style == 'pills' %}
      .ai-sauna-benefits-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        border-radius: {{ block.settings.tab_pill_radius }}px;
        padding: {{ block.settings.pill_height_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.pill_width_mobile }}px;
      }
    {% endif %}

    .ai-sauna-benefits-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .ai-sauna-benefits-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-sauna-benefits-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
    }

    .ai-sauna-benefits-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .ai-sauna-benefits-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .ai-sauna-benefits-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<sauna-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-sauna-benefits-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.subtitle != blank %}
        <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subtitle }}</div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-sauna-benefits-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-tabs-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-tabs-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <button class="ai-sauna-benefits-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }} active" data-tab="performance">Performance</button>
        <button class="ai-sauna-benefits-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-tab="health">Health</button>
        <button class="ai-sauna-benefits-tab-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-tab="longevity">Longevity</button>
        <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-tab-indicator-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-tab-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} active" data-content="performance">
        <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.performance_image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.performance_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.performance_image.alt | escape }}"
              width="{{ block.settings.performance_image.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.performance_image.height }}"
              class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-sauna-benefits-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-sauna-benefits-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                Add Performance desktop image
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.performance_image_mobile %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.performance_image_mobile | image_url: width: 1000 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.performance_image_mobile.alt | escape }}"
              width="{{ block.settings.performance_image_mobile.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.performance_image_mobile.height }}"
              class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-sauna-benefits-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
          {% elsif block.settings.performance_image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.performance_image | image_url: width: 1000 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.performance_image.alt | escape }}"
              width="{{ block.settings.performance_image.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.performance_image.height }}"
              class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-sauna-benefits-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-sauna-benefits-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                Add Performance mobile image
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% for i in (1..6) %}
            {% liquid
              assign title_key = 'performance_benefit_' | append: i | append: '_title'
              assign desc_key = 'performance_benefit_' | append: i | append: '_description'
              assign title = block.settings[title_key]
              assign description = block.settings[desc_key]
            %}
            {% if title != blank or description != blank %}
              <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if title != blank %}
                  <h3 class="ai-sauna-benefits-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ title }}</h3>
                {% endif %}
                {% if description != blank %}
                  <p class="ai-sauna-benefits-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ description }}</p>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-tab-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-content="health">
        <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.health_image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.health_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.health_image.alt | escape }}"
              width="{{ block.settings.health_image.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.health_image.height }}"
              class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-sauna-benefits-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-sauna-benefits-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                Add Health desktop image
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.health_image_mobile %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.health_image_mobile | image_url: width: 1000 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.health_image_mobile.alt | escape }}"
              width="{{ block.settings.health_image_mobile.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.health_image_mobile.height }}"
              class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-sauna-benefits-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
          {% elsif block.settings.health_image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.health_image | image_url: width: 1000 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.health_image.alt | escape }}"
              width="{{ block.settings.health_image.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.health_image.height }}"
              class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-sauna-benefits-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-sauna-benefits-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                Add Health mobile image
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% for i in (1..6) %}
            {% liquid
              assign title_key = 'health_benefit_' | append: i | append: '_title'
              assign desc_key = 'health_benefit_' | append: i | append: '_description'
              assign title = block.settings[title_key]
              assign description = block.settings[desc_key]
            %}
            {% if title != blank or description != blank %}
              <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if title != blank %}
                  <h3 class="ai-sauna-benefits-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ title }}</h3>
                {% endif %}
                {% if description != blank %}
                  <p class="ai-sauna-benefits-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ description }}</p>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-tab-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-content="longevity">
        <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.longevity_image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.longevity_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.longevity_image.alt | escape }}"
              width="{{ block.settings.longevity_image.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.longevity_image.height }}"
              class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-sauna-benefits-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-sauna-benefits-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
              <div class="ai-sauna-benefits-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                Add Longevity desktop image
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.longevity_image_mobile %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.longevity_image_mobile | image_url: width: 1000 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.longevity_image_mobile.alt | escape }}"
              width="{{ block.settings.longevity_image_mobile.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.longevity_image_mobile.height }}"
